    {
      "id": "df8e9aba-e67f-53fa-b421-e9a758d11bd0",
      "type": "Information",
      "label": {
        "en": "Researcher notes (delete before fielding)"
      },
      "content": {
        "en": "# Notes for the research team\n\n**About this draft.** Sketch drafted this protocol from a study description. Review every stage before fielding.\n\n**Study.** A messy study of support.\n\n**Changes Sketch made.**\n- Two node types / relationships use id \"person\"; the second became \"person_2\". Give each its own id.\n- Consent attribute \"participant_consent\" was replaced by the built-in consent question (includeConsent); the interview ends if the participant declines.\n- Two different attributes use id \"age\"; the second became \"age_2\" and every reference to \"age\" points at the first. Give each attribute its own id.\n- ordered attribute \"mood\" needs at least 2 options; it was turned into free text.\n- optionScores of \"scale\" must be one distinct whole number per option (3); they were dropped and options scored 1..n.\n- Stage \"early\" uses \"person\" nodes before any earlier nameGenerator creates them. The stage was removed.\n- Skip condition tests \"smokes\" on egoAttributes, which no EARLIER stage collects.\n- mode skip_if has no usable conditions; the stage is always shown.\n- Form attribute \"undefined_attr\" is not an attribute of egoAttributes. Matching attributes there: age (number), age_2 (text), smokes (yes_no), mood (text), scale (ordered).\n- Form attribute \"closeness\" is not an attribute of egoAttributes. Matching attributes there: age (number), age_2 (text), smokes (yes_no), mood (text), scale (ordered).\n- Prompt without text removed.\n- a yes_no value must be \"yes\" or \"no\" (got \"maybe\"). Condition removed.\n- Bin attribute \"close\" on node type \"person\" is yes_no, but this needs ordered or single_choice. Matching attributes there: person_closeness (ordered).\n- narrative \"story\" needs an EARLIER sociogram of node type \"person\" (it reuses that map's positions). Add one, or remove the narrative. The stage was removed.\n- relationship \"knows\" is not declared. Declared: person_2.\n- Highlight \"person_closeness\" is ordered; highlights must be yes_no. Prompt removed.\n- relationship \"person\" is not declared. Declared: person_2.\n- relationshipForm \"edge_form\" has no valid relationship. The stage was removed.\n- mode show_only_if has no usable conditions; the stage is always shown."
      }
    },
